<!doctype html>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="TestS.css">
<h1>Do you think you are cool?</h1>
<p>If you think you are, find out for sure by taking the Ultimate Coolness Test! Please fill out your <label for="nameIN">name</label> and answer these questions!</p>
<p id="green"></p><p id="red"></p>
<div id="name">
<p>Enter your name:</p>
<input id="nameIN" placeholder="Enter">
</div>
<div id="answers">
<p id="Q9A">17</p>
<p id="Q10A1">cool</p>
<p id="Q10A2">Cool</p>
</div>
<div id="questions">
<p>Q1: Who is the person you like the most?</p>
<select id="Q1" value="Enter">
<option>Baha</option>
<option value="correct">You</option>
<option>Your mom</option>
<option>Barney</option>
</select>

<p>Q2: What book do you read at school?</p>
<select id="Q2" value="Enter">
<option value="correct">Middle School</option>
<option>Percy Jackson</option>
<option>Math Workbook</option>
<option>Dictionary</option>
</select>

<p>Q3: What do you think is the best kind of haircut?</p>
<select value="Enter" id="Q3">
<option>Bald</option>
<option>Mohawk</option>
<option>Afro</option>
<option value="correct">Short, shiny and combover</option>
</select>

<p>Q4: Where do you buy stuff?</p>
<select value="Enter" id="Q4">
<option value="correct">Comissary</option>
<option>Panda</option>
<option>Walmart</option>
<option>Campervan</option>
</select>

<p>Q5: What is the coolest thing listed here?</p>
<select id="Q5" value="Enter">
<option>Nike shoes</option>
<option>Addidas cleats</option>
<option value="correct">Baha</option>
<option>Ray-Bans</option>
</select>

<p>Q6: Why is water blue?</p>
<select id="Q6">
<option>Because of the sky</option>
<option>Blue is the new red</option>
<option>It likes blue cheese</option>
<option value="correct">Because you are in it</option>
</select>

<p>Q7: What is 9+10?</p>
<select id="Q7" value="Enter">
<option>19</option>
<option>I dunno</option>
<option value="correct">21</option>
<option>I'm so cool</option>
</select>

<p>Q8: What do you do during nutrition break?</p>
<select id="Q8">
<option>Talk about math</option>
<option value="correct">Play on your phone</option>
<option>Play wallball</option>
<option>Eat a sandvich</option>
</select>

<p>Q9: What is your favorite Fifa? Number only</p>
<input id="Q9" type="number">

<p>Q10: What rhymes with drool and is an adjective to describe yourself?</p>
<input id="Q10" placeholder="Mule?">
</div><br>

<script type="text/javascript" src="Checker.js">
</script>

<button onclick="Submit()">SUBMIT!</button><br><p>To try the test again, go to main menu and select this.</p>